		f4^\markup { \musicglyph #"scripts.segno" } r8 g a bes c4 | r8 f e f d bes a g | c4 r8 d ees d c4 | r8 f \tuplet 3/2 { ees8 bes g } d' des c f,~^\markup { To Coda \musicglyph #"scripts.coda" } |
