		bes8 des, d f a a aes g~ | g1 | r1^\markup { 2nd time D.S. al Coda } |
	}

	% part "Coda"
	f1~ | f2. r8 f | g f g aes a f' c4 | fis,8 g c f~ f ees c des |
	d8 bes a g c bes r4 | r8 des, d f a a aes g~ | g1~ | g2. r4 |
}
